  "interpretation": "The smoke pass now needs one source-local bind-group set per compute pass instead of a Globals bind plus smoke bind. All four fixed-tick scenes (clearing, dual-emitter, profiling-heavy and materials) match byte-for-byte. On the clearing route, simulation CPU-encode medians fell 0.005/0.015/0.011 ms across three pairs; the added profiling-heavy and materials routes do not repeat a consistent CPU-encode improvement. GPU-render signs are mixed on clearing/materials and consistently -0.006 to -0.009 ms on profiling-heavy. Keep as a reduced command count with workload-dependent measured timing, not a general performance claim.",
